The first vector build failed on Vls16-vloxei64.v-00 (Sail "Trap signature overflow"), one of the
43 tests listed in act-vector-core-genfail-2026-10-14.csv. With this riscv-arch-test pin, the
unpriv vector .S sources are written by the `make elfs` step, not by `make vector-tests` (which
generated only priv vector suites), so "moved aside: 0" above: the sources did not exist yet.
After that first build the 43 listed sources were moved out of tests/rv64i/ (and tests/rv32i/),
and the vector build was rerun:
    moved aside rv64i: 43
    vec rc=0 194s; Build complete: 5917 succeeded, 2219 up-to-date
    regenerated after move: 0
    elfs: 2578   (Vx 821, Vls 1051, Vf 162; scalar + priv 544)
sw/act4-core/README.md step 4 ("move the sources ... first") does not work as written with this
pin; the order above (build, move, rebuild) does. The README is outside #56 and is left as is.
